{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <i>Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age</i>,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chaotic 2\u20134 player competitive shop management game where <strong>gutsy pricing, clever shelf setups, and sneaky sabotage</strong> are your weapons in the market war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/box.gif?t=1749425313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Loop: 15 Days of Goblin Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run begins with one of 25 randomized economic scenarios that shift product prices and stock levels. Every day, players have limited time to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase products from the supplier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set competitive prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamble at the <i>Wheel of Chance</i> for risky bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for customers in real time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once players flip their signs, sales begin: customers flow in, grab what they want, and check out at your register\u2014fast hands and calm nerves win gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/register.gif?t=1749425313\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>End-of-Day &amp; Witch Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each day, players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Review profits and reputation gains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 3 mysterious Witch Cards: blessings or curses<br>(e.g., price hikes, shelf buffs, stealing rival fame)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each card can turn the tides\u2014<strong>a well-timed curse could ruin a rival\u2019s empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/witch.gif?t=1749425313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Victory Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching 100 reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ending Day 15 with the most gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being the last player standing (no bankruptcy)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/wheel.gif?t=1749425313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smart, fast-paced economic decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real player interactions: price wars, sabotage, psychological mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily randomness keeps each session fresh</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre goblin world filled with charm and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade smart. Hex hard. Rule the goblin market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is not capitalism. This is survival.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420920?t=1749425313","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/8fd6db03f32b7adc99f3bf8807408755ed01f029/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749425313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/e4f93d4ed1959673339e65637bdae00fd7fa4d19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749425313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/e4f93d4ed1959673339e65637bdae00fd7fa4d19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749425313","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id