 3 mysterious Witch Cards: blessings or curses<br>(e.g., price hikes, shelf buffs, stealing rival fame)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each card can turn the tides\u2014<strong>a well-timed curse could ruin a rival\u2019s empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/witch.gif?t=1749425313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Victory Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching 100 reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ending Day 15 with the most gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being the last player standing (no bankruptcy)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/wheel.gif?t=1749425313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smart, fast-paced economic decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real player interactions: price wars, sabotage, psychological mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily randomness keeps each session fresh</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre goblin world filled with charm and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade smart. Hex hard. Rule the goblin market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is not capitalism. This is survival.</strong></p>","developers":["Roog Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/58846f07c0260beac38a95d0b86dac5654d6b946/header.jpg?t=1749425313","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true