2f7fa0b9a4be92345836de047ff6fb2cc8fa7.600x338.jpg?t=1749425313"}],"short_description":"Build your goblin shop empire in this competitive business sim for 2\u20134 friends. Set prices, fight for fame, and sabotage rivals\u2014all in a race to survive 15 chaotic days. Outsmart, out-sell, or outlast your way to victory in Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age!","steam_appid":3420920,"support_info":{"email":"info@rooggames.com","url":"https://traderivals.com/feedback"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Dutch, Arabic, Korean, Norwegian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://traderivals.com/"}